WHERE \"posts\".\"name\" = 'test' AND \"comments\".\"post_id\" = $2\n```\n\nand this is the stack:\n\n```\nE\n\nFinished in 0.072425s, 13.8074 runs/s, 0.0000 assertions/s.\n\n  1) Error:\nBugTest#test_association_stuff:\nActiveRecord::StatementInvalid: PG::ProtocolViolation: ERROR:  bind message supplies 1 parameters, but prepared statement \"a4\" requires 2\n: SELECT \"comments\".* FROM \"comments\" INNER JOIN \"posts\" ON \"posts\".\"id\" = \"comments\".\"post_id\" AND \"posts\".\"name\" = $1 WHERE \"posts\".\"name\" = 'test' AND \"comments\".\"post_id\" = $2\n    /Users/paule/.rbenv/versions/2.2.0-preview1/lib/ruby/gems/2.2.0/gems/activerecord-4.2.0.beta4/lib/active_record/connection_adapters/postgresql_adapter.rb:590:in `get_last_result'\n    /Users/paule/.rbenv/versions/2.2.0-preview1/lib/ruby/gems/2.2.0/gems/activerecord-4.2.0.beta4/lib/active_record/connection_adapters/postgresql_adapter.rb:590:in `block in exec_cache'\n    /Users/paule/.rbenv/versions/2.2.0-preview1/lib/ruby/gems/2.2.0/gems/activerecord-4.2.0.beta4/lib/active_record/connection_adapters/abstract_adapter.rb:464:in `block in log'\n    /Users/paule/.rbenv/versions/2.2.0-preview1/lib/ruby/gems/2.2.0/gems/activesupport-4.2.0.beta4/lib/active_support/notifications/instrumenter.rb:20:in `instrument'\n    /Users/paule/.rbenv/versions/2.2.0-preview1/lib/ruby/gems/2.2.0/gems/activerecord-4.2.0.beta4/lib/active_record/connection_adapters/abstract_adapter.rb:458:in `log'\n    /Users/paule/.rbenv/versions/2.2.0-preview1/lib/ruby/gems/2.2.0/gems/activerecord-4.2.0.beta4/lib/active_record/connection_adapters/postgresql_adapter.rb:587:in `exec_cache'\n    /Users/paule/.rbenv/versions/2.2.0-preview1/lib/ruby/gems/2.2.0/gems/activerecord-4.2.0.beta4/lib/active_record/connection_adapters/postgresql_adapter.rb:571:in `execute_and_clear'\n    /Users/paule/.rbenv/versions/2.2.0-preview1/lib/ruby/gems/2.2.0/gems/activerecord-4.2.0.beta4/lib/active_record/connection_adapters/postgresql/database_statements.rb:164:in 